<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Insert title here</title>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Container -->
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
      style="max-width:600px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden;">

      <!-- Header -->
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:40px 40px 28px; text-align:center;">

          <div style="
            display:inline-block;
            width:52px;
            height:52px;
            line-height:52px;
            border-radius:16px;
            background:#111827;
            color:#ffffff;
            font-size:22px;
            font-weight:700;
            margin-bottom:24px;
          ">
            ✦
          </div>

          <div style="
            font-size:14px;
            font-weight:700;
            letter-spacing:1.5px;
            color:#6b7280;
            margin-bottom:14px;
          ">
            WELCOME
          </div>

          <h1 style="
            margin:0;
            font-size:30px;
            line-height:1.4;
            font-weight:700;
            letter-spacing:-1px;
            color:#111827;
          ">
            ${USER_NAME}님의  회원가입을<br>
            진심으로 축하합니다.
          </h1>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px 40px 42px;">

          <p style="
            margin:0 0 12px;
            font-size:16px;
            line-height:1.8;
            color:#374151;
            text-align:center;
          ">
            이제 <strong style="color:#111827;">[${SERVICE_NAME}]</strong>의<br>
            새로운 여정을 함께 시작합니다.
          </p>

          <p style="
            margin:0;
            font-size:14px;
            line-height:1.8;
            color:#9ca3af;
            text-align:center;
          ">
            가입해 주셔서 감사합니다.<br>
            더 나은 경험과 유용한 서비스를 제공해 드리겠습니다.
          </p>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div style="height:1px; background:#eef0f3; margin:36px 0;"></div>

          <!-- Welcome Box -->
          <div style="
            background:#f8fafc;
            border-radius:14px;
            padding:24px;
          ">

            <div style="
              font-size:12px;
              font-weight:700;
              color:#9ca3af;
              letter-spacing:.5px;
              margin-bottom:8px;
            ">
              YOUR ACCOUNT
            </div>

            <div style="
              font-size:16px;
              font-weight:600;
              color:#111827;
            ">
              ${USER_EMAIL}
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Button -->
          <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:32px;">

            <a href="{{SERVICE_URL}}"
              style="
                display:inline-block;
                padding:15px 32px;
                background:#111827;
                color:#ffffff;
                text-decoration:none;
                border-radius:10px;
                font-size:14px;
                font-weight:600;
              ">
              서비스 시작하기 →
            </a>

          </div>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <tr>
        <td style="
          padding:24px 40px 32px;
          background:#fafafa;
          border-top:1px solid #f0f0f0;
          text-align:center;
        ">

          <p style="
            margin:0 0 8px;
            font-size:12px;
            line-height:1.6;
            color:#9ca3af;
          ">
            본 메일은 회원가입 완료를 위해 자동으로 발송되었습니다.
          </p>

          <p style="
            margin:0;
            font-size:11px;
            color:#d1d5db;
          ">
            © 2026 [서비스명]. All rights reserved.
          </p>

        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>

  </td>
</tr>

</body>
</html>